# Stray root-level trades.db (the real one is logs/trades.db, covered by logs/
# above) — a diagnostic sqlite3.connect('trades.db') one-liner run from repo
# root creates this untracked; a broad `git add` swept it into a commit once
# before (2026-07-30, see .memory/decisions/known-gaps.md #16). Never real data.
/trades.db

